            <ArticleTitle>Traumatic rupture of corpus cavernosum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>204-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Traumatic rupture of corpora cavernosa is an uncommon injury. We report a case of fractured penis in a 60 year old which was managed by immediate exploration and operative repair. Post operative recovery was uneventful with full return of erectile function.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
